# Gate step 1310-rec6 — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq).
#
# WHAT IT GUARDS. The git mirror's container HEALTHCHECK used to be
# `nc -w 1 127.0.0.1 9418` every 2 s; each probe made git-daemon log
# `fatal: the remote end hung up unexpectedly` (23,209 in one lenovinha
# container log, all healthcheck, none relay), so a healthy mirror's log could
# not be told from a failing one. The probe now checks the daemon's LISTEN
# socket and never connects. Runs in the tillandsias-git image (the only place
# git-daemon exists here) with the image's own healthcheck disabled; skips by
# name without podman or the image.
#
# STEP_SCRIPT is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
STEP_DESC="Checking the git mirror's healthcheck writes nothing to the daemon log and still detects a dead daemon (1310-rec6)"
STEP_SCRIPT="scripts/test-mirror-healthcheck-quiet.sh"
STEP_ERROR="the git mirror healthcheck again writes to git-daemon's log (fatal: the remote end hung up) or no longer detects a dead daemon (1310-rec6)"
STEP_OK="mirror healthcheck is silent and still a liveness check"
